        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>ExecuteAsyncCallback</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Type alias for the callback function used in asynchronous execution operations. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This callback function is invoked when an asynchronous operation completes. The callback receives the job handle containing the completion status.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>job_handle</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The handle of the completed asynchronous job, containing the final status and job identifier.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>The callback may be invoked from an internal worker thread, so users must ensure thread safety when accessing shared resources. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
